        "content": "\n          <p>Examine the operational contrasts between considerate, mature graduate behavior and common post-service relationship pitfalls:</p>\n          <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n            <table class=\"data-table\">\n              <thead>\n                <tr>\n                  <th>Evaluation Dimension</th>\n                  <th>Mature Graduate Best Practices</th>\n                  <th>High-Risk Relationship Mistakes</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                  <td><strong>Financial Expectations</strong></td>\n                  <td>Living within actual monthly stipend and entry-level wages.</td>\n                  <td>Accumulating debt to fund performative dates in expensive city clubs.</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td><strong>Career Support</strong></td>\n                  <td>Reviewing CVs, sharing job leads, and celebrating interviews.</td>\n                  <td>Fostering bitter resentment when one partner secures employment first.</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td><strong>Long-Distance Travel</strong></td>\n                  <td>Daylight travel using registered interstate transit companies.</td>\n                  <td>Embarking on dangerous nighttime journeys along insecure highway corridors.</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td><strong>Family Transparency</strong></td>\n                  <td>Communicating future intentions with parents with calm maturity.</td>\n                  <td>Concealing relationship or bowing to petty parental tribal objections.</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td><strong>Vision Alignment</strong></td>\n                  <td>Agreeing on target cities, career goals, and marriage timelines.</td>\n                  <td>Drifting indefinitely without clear shared milestones or commitments.</td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n          </div>\n  "
